---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Page not found | SubFixer" description="That page is not here. Pick a fix instead: sync, conversion and repair for subtitle files, free in your browser." path="/404.html" noindex>
  <h1>That page is not here</h1>
  <p class="lede">The link may be old, or the address may have a typo. Start with the fix for your problem.</p>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>Fix a subtitle problem</h2>
    <ul class="plainlist spaced">
      <li><a href="/">Open the subtitle fixer</a> and drop your file in. The tool works out which lines are wrong.</li>
      <li><a href="/shift-subtitle-timing/">Shift subtitle timing</a> when everything is early or late by the same amount.</li>
      <li><a href="/convert-25-fps-to-23976/">Convert 25 fps to 23.976</a> when the drift gets worse as the video goes on.</li>
      <li><a href="/fix-subtitle-encoding/">Fix garbled characters</a> when letters show up as accents gone wrong or question marks.</li>
      <li><a href="/subtitle-reading-speed/">Check reading speed</a> when lines flash past too fast to read.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>Convert a file</h2>
    <ul class="plainlist spaced">
      <li><a href="/srt-to-vtt/">SRT to VTT</a> · <a href="/vtt-to-srt/">VTT to SRT</a> · <a href="/ass-to-srt/">ASS to SRT</a> · <a href="/srt-to-ass/">SRT to ASS</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sbv-to-srt/">SBV to SRT</a> for YouTube caption downloads · <a href="/txt-to-srt/">TXT to SRT</a> for plain transcripts</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>Or read the guides</h2>
    <ul class="plainlist spaced">
      <li><a href="/guides/subtitles-out-of-sync/">Why subtitles go out of sync, and which fix to use</a></li>
      <li><a href="/guides/srt-vtt-ass/">SRT, VTT and ASS: what is the difference?</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
